"""Independent verifier for the Quant Research Protocol.

The verifier uses only the Python standard library. It launches a stdio MCP
runtime, or connects to a loopback Streamable HTTP runtime, performs read-only
protocol discovery, and validates the machine-readable contract. It never runs
a factor, mutates research state, uploads local data, or trusts self-reported
conformance without checking the observable MCP surface.
"""
